      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary artery spasm has been shown to play an important role in the pathogenesis of not only variant angina but also various arrhythmias. We present a case report of coronary vasospasm-induced arrhythmia and review the prevalence, mechanism, prognosis and management of this problem."},
